  "title": "pr-lens workflow: provider fallback and lens retry",
  "summary": "The pr-lens GitHub Actions workflow gains a fifth column in its provider table (temperature), a new PR_LENS_OPENAI_MODEL repository variable, and a two-stage retry: each provider is first asked for both lenses, then for the architecture lens alone, before the next provider is tried. OpenAI rows are skipped when no model is configured, and the skip is reported in the failure note. The CLI pin moves from 0.11.0 to 0.13.0.",
